        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "70719919-1060-5847-a9dc-48bdec025ee7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dale Hamer\n- Organizations: National Football League (NFL), American Football Conference (AFC), National Football Conference (NFC)\n- Events: Super Bowl XVII, Super Bowl XXII\n- Roles: American football official, head linesman\n- Teams: Miami Dolphins, Washington Redskins\n\nFacts:\n- Dale Hamer served as an American football official in the National Football League from 1978 to 2001, with a health-related break during the 1995 season.\n- Super Bowl XVII was played to decide the National Football League champion for the 1982 season.\n- Super Bowl XVII matched the American Football Conference champion Miami Dolphins against the National Football Conference champion Washington Redskins.\n- During 23 NFL seasons, Dale Hamer was assigned as head linesman for Super Bowl XVII and Super Bowl XXII.",
